  summary "Seciae~, a penguin engineer in the colony of ☽'scar Ramtatus~, successfully develops a technique combining aurora-crystals with fire-cores to create self-sustaining light and heat, impressing Umbra-Princeps Alnae~ Oss and spreading a new ideology of fire-based independence among the workers. However, as the colony expands deeper into unmapped ice, Seciae~ detects a returning wrongness and corruption near the Marker that previous sanctification rites had only temporarily suppressed, suggesting the technique's success may have dangerous consequences the colony is not prepared to face."
